<!-- 
| Feature/Gaps           | Status    | Technical Observation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| **Register Map**       | **FULL**  | Populated based on `ir_reg.h`. Covers both Infrared Transmit (TX) and Receive (RX) logic.                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| **Protocol Support**   | **FULL**  | Includes configuration for Head, Tail, Logic 0/1, and Frame segments. Supports PWM/Modulation-based IR (e.g., NEC, RC5/6).                                                                                                                                                            |
| **FIFO Management**    | **FULL**  | Integrated DMA support, overflow/underflow monitoring, and configurable thresholds for both TX/RX streams.                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **Timing Precision**   | **FULL**  | Captures precise phase widths (`irtx_pulse_width`, `irtx_pw_0`, `irtx_pw_1`) and RX thresholds (`irrx_pw_config`).                                                                                                                                                                  |
| **Interrupts**         | **FULL**  | Maps End-of-Transfer, FIFO Ready, and FIFO Error interrupts for both TX and RX chains.                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| **Reset Values**       | Added     | Reset values for all fields integrated from the `struct ir_reg` bitfield annotations in the header.                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Base Address**       | Explicit | 0x2000A600 (based on `bl808.h`).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
-->
